","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implemented and pushed for review as https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1033 (change 1033). (1) workflow_ops.py code_review_decide: nit suppression now impact-aware — docs/llm-prompts-only advisories dropped only when impact == 0; impact > 0 surfaces as advisory. (2) code-review-docs.md narrowed: both-sides-in-diff requirement + explicit prohibition on absence speculation about files not in the diff. (3) tests/unit/test_code_review_nit_suppression.py (8 tests) covers all AC. Gates green: lint, mypy, 294 code-review unit tests. Awaiting LLM-Review/Verified.","timestamp":1785397429972475001}],"created_at":1785384339334440001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d59281d6-b4b6-4935-acb4-be1c46d08508","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a298-36db-a8b4-4aca"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe docs overlay reviewer tags all its findings docs-only (src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-docs.md:19); routing gives docs `nit_suppressed: true` and `blocking_enabled: false` (src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json:57-68); post-Pass-3 nit suppression (src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py:426-446) demotes every docs-only advisory. Net: 100% of the overlay's verified-valid output is discarded — 47 of 125 nit-suppressed findings had validity >= 0.8 AND impact > 0 (e.g. a CONTRIBUTING.md path list factually wrong vs the checker). Separately, 95 findings were absence-speculation (\"file may not exist\") from the tool-less overlay, correctly refuted at Pass-2 but billed.\n\n## Approach\nTwo changes: (1) make nit suppression impact-aware at workflow_ops.py:443-446 — suppress a docs-only advisory only when its impact is 0; findings with impact > 0 surface as advisories. (2) Narrow code-review-docs.md: report only inconsistencies where the diff itself shows both sides; explicitly forbid emitting \"must exist / may be stale / should be verified\" speculation about files not in the diff. Alternative rejected: dropping nit_suppressed from routing entirely — re-admits the 61 zero-impact nits the suppression correctly removes.\n\n## Scope\nsrc/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py, src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-docs.md, tests/llm/test_code_review_nit_suppression.py.\n\n## Testing\nUnit on the Pass-3/post-decide pipeline with fixture findings: docs-only + impact 0.3 survives as advisory; docs-only + impact 0 suppressed; multi-criteria behavior unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A docs-only advisory with impact > 0 survives nit suppression and surfaces (checked: pipeline unit test).\n- [ ] A docs-only advisory with impact == 0 remains suppressed (checked: pipeline unit test).\n- [ ] code-review-docs.md contains an explicit prohibition on absence speculation about files not shown in the diff (checked: test asserts the rubric text contains the prohibition).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py","reason":"impact-aware nit suppression"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-docs.md","reason":"absence-speculation ban"},{"path":"tests/llm/test_code_review_nit_suppression.py","reason":"new tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","a492-3e46-ca44-40a5"],["relates_to","a298-36db-a8b4-4aca"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"a492-3e46-ca44-40a5","parent_status_uuid":"43779eb8-decd-4472-9e9d-baf22d87814a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2dfe-2552-ff1e-42ae","ticket_type":"bug","title":"docs code-review findings are structurally unsurfaceable","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ba4e4d2f-bcdd-4f37-9f22-ba490633aaa5","3e3976eb-0dc6-46d0-a8e9-790a0f180cff","43779eb8-decd-4472-9e9